00%;\" class=\"slide-2813 ms-image\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\" aria-label=\"slide-2813\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5417f_resize-2-1920x450.jpg\" height=\"450\" width=\"1920\" alt=\"\" class=\"slider-2812 slide-2813\" title=\"_ANK5417f_resize-2\"></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>                  \n       \n        \t\t</div>\n                \n        </header>\n\t                                                 \n\t<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-content\">\n  \n                                             \n   \n             \n                                  \n          \n    <div id=\"primary\" class=\"content-area\">\n        <main id=\"main\" class=\"site-main\" role=\"main\">\n            <div class=\"primary_next\">            \n                <div class=\"entry-content2\">\n                    <div class=\"upravy_obsah\"><div id=\"radek_0\" class=\"barva_1\"><ul class=\"sirein\"><li class=\"celasire entry-content\"><div class=\"inli\"><h1>Accommodation in the centre of Roudnice nad Labem</h1>\n<p>When it comes to location, you won’t find more conveniently located accommodation in Roudnice. Hotel Magnolia is located in the very centre of the city right on Karlovo náměstí (Charles Square). You are literally just a few steps away from the local landmark&nbsp;– Roudnice Castle. Moreover, the square is only a few minutes from the train station and is the starting and finishing point of countless trips. After a trip here, however, lovers of good coffee and sweet treats will also find it to their liking. In fact, there are 3&nbsp;pastry shops on the square.</p>\n</div></li></ul></div><div class=\"nextsession\"></div><div class=\"barva_1\"><ul class=\"sirein\"><li class=\"sire2b\"><div class=\"inli prvek_1\">\n                  <div class=\"obsah_u\"><h2>38&nbsp;cosy rooms</h2>\n<p>The 38&nbsp;cosy and comfortably furnished rooms are divided into 29&nbsp;double rooms and 1&nbsp;single room. For more demanding guests there are 3&nbsp;suites. Classic room amenities include private bathroom and TV. In the rooms you have the possibility to connect to the Internet.</p>\n</div>\n              </div></li><li class=\"sire2b\"><div class=\"inli prvek_2\">\n                  <div class=\"obsah_u\"><p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2854 size-large\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5383-copy_resize-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"440\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5383-copy_resize-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5383-copy_resize-300x200.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5383-copy_resize-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5383-copy_resize.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\"></p>\n</div>\n              </div></li><li class=\"sire2b\"><div class=\"inli prvek_3\">\n                  <div class=\"obsah_u\"><p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2915 size-large\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/cyklostezka-labe-1024x683.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"440\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/cyklostezka-labe-1024x683.jpeg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/cyklostezka-labe-300x200.jpeg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/cyklostezka-labe-768x512.jpeg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/cyklostezka-labe.jpeg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\"></p>\n</div>\n              </div></li><li class=\"sire2b\"><div class=\"inli prvek_4\">\n                  <div class=\"obsah_u\"><h2>Accommodation for cyclists</h2>\n<p>Roudnice nad Labem and its surroundings are a true paradise for cyclists. The area around Hotel Magnolia offers countless cycle paths. They avoid busy roads and are a great choice for families with children too. Among other places, you can ride to the famous Říp Mountain.</p>\n</div>\n              </div></li><li class=\"sire2b\"><div class=\"inli prvek_5\">\n                  <div class=\"obsah_u\"><h2>A great place for weddings and events</h2>\n<p>There are several restaurants and a&nbsp;<a href=\"/en/conference/\">conference hall</a> on the hotel premises. Hotel Magnolia is a great place for your event. Accommodating a larger number of guests is no problem.</p>\n</div>\n              </div></li><li class=\"sire2b\"><div class=\"inli prvek_6\">\n                  <div class=\"obsah_u\"><p><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-2860\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5196f_resize-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"660\" height=\"440\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5196f_resize-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5196f_resize-300x200.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5196f_resize-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/06/ANK5196f_resize.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px\"></p>\n</div>\n              </div></li></ul></div><div class=\"nextsession\"></div></div>                             \n\n\n                </div>                                \n            </div>    \n        </main>         \n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"kontatk_form\">\n        <h2 class=\"entry-title\">Vaše dotazy<span></span></h2>\n      \n        <div role=\"form\" class=\"wpcf7\" id=\"wpcf7-f2614-o1\" lang=\"cs-CZ\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\"><p role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></p> <ul></ul></div>\n<form action=\"\" method=\"post\" class=\"wpcf7-form init\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" data-status=\"init\">\n<div style=\"display: none;\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"2614\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_version\" value=\"5.4.1\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" value=\"cs_CZ\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" value=\"wpcf7-f2614-o1\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_container_post\" value=\"0\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_posted_data_hash\" value=\"\">\n</div>\n<h2 cla